    "media:imagetext": "1930\nNR\n6020\n197\nM\nMISSION\nSUCCESS\nOUR COMMITMENT TO ACHIEVE\nSUPFRIOR PERFORMANCE\nAND TOTAL CUSTOMER\nSATISFACTION IN EVERY TASK\nWE UNDERTAKE\nAND EVERY GOAL WE SET\n1948\narom the depths of the\nEarth's oceans to the\nfar reaches of space\nthe dedicated employees of\nLockheed Martin heritage\ncompanies have participated in\nmany of humankind's greatest\ntechnological achievements\nNo matter how diverse their\naccomplishments and back.\ngrounds, the people who com-\nprise Lockheed Martin have\nalways been driven by a single\ngoal: Mission Success. The\nmilestones listed here\nrepresent that proud tradition.\nAlthough they only scratch\nthe surface of a broad and\nillustrious history, these select-\ned events are a reflection of\nthe commitment. the drive and\nthe ingenuity of Lockheed\nMartin employees. They provide\nthe foundation for an equally\ntriumphant future.\n1964\n1951\n1965\n\"A REAL FIREBALL\nHE'S BACK!\n1976\n1977\n1978\n1979\n198\n1983\n1988\n1989",
